---
import { site, asset } from '../content/site';
---
<footer class="footer" id="contacts"><div class="container footer-grid"><div><a class="brand footer-brand" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}><strong>{site.name}</strong><small>{site.byline}</small></a><p>Практические разборы производства AI-видео.</p></div><address><b>Исполнитель: {site.business.performer}</b><span>Статус: {site.business.status}</span><span>ИНН: {site.business.inn}</span><a href={`mailto:${site.business.email}`}>Email: {site.business.email}</a><a href={site.business.telegram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Telegram: {site.business.telegram}</a></address><nav aria-label="Правовая информация"><a href={asset(site.legal.offer)}>Публичная оферта</a><a href={asset(site.legal.privacy)}>Политика конфиденциальности</a><a href={asset(site.legal.contacts)}>Контакты</a></nav></div><div class="container copyright">© {new Date().getFullYear()} NeuroVideo <span>Информационный ресурс</span></div></footer>
